      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So absolutely love everything about this world. I&#39;m sure this question gets asked a lot and I had assumed that the only comic of SOTM there was, was Annual #1. Well, I&#39;ve recently found the Podcast that discusses the lore of the characters and I&#39;ve been tearing through as fast as I can. I&#39;ve noticed though that they are referencing&nbsp;several books and stories (Like the Trial of Baron Blade) and I&#39;ve been looking all over the internet trying to find these comics.&nbsp;<br />So I have to ask, are there any comics that have been written for these characters outside of Annual #1, or are they referencing their own storyboards and note cards as they tell us?</p>",
